Now we need to detach task profile after we are done with all steps that need it (apply_operational_constraint, confirm_operator_alignment maybe). After finalize, we may not need task profile linked. So we can detach after finalize or before.

Now we need to allocate dispatch slot and vehicle for dispatch.

