Now we need to ensure origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready before assembling leg.

Activate origin node: we already did.

Activate destination node: similar.

Now after both origin and destination locked/confirmed and nodes ready, we can assemble transport leg.

We have transport_leg_alpha available.

We need to choose which assemble action: Since we haven't loaded any payload yet (we haven't loaded origin or destination payload). The assemble_transport_leg action requires origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready (not occupied). Since we haven't loaded cargo, nodes are ready not occupied. So we can use assemble_transport_leg.

